{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\",\"Umber\"],\"fuel\":17,\"goal\":\"Umber\",\"start\":\"Vesper\",\"edges\":[[\"Vesper\",\"Obsidian\",2],[\"Obsidian\",\"Zephyr\",2],[\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",2],[\"Nacre\",\"Tundra\",4],[\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",3],[\"Quasar\",\"Sirocco\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Umber\",2],[\"Vesper\",\"Umber\",18],[\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\",3],[\"Zephyr\",\"Vesper\",5],[\"Tundra\",\"Vesper\",5],[\"Tundra\",\"Zephyr\",4],[\"Tundra\",\"Nacre\",1],[\"Tundra\",\"Sirocco\",5],[\"Quasar\",\"Nacre\",1],[\"Quasar\",\"Tundra\",1],[\"Sirocco\",\"Vesper\",4],[\"Sirocco\",\"Obsidian\",3],[\"Umber\",\"Nacre\",6],[\"Umber\",\"Sirocco\",6]],\"nodes\":[\"Vesper\",\"Obsidian\",\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",\"Sirocco\",\"Umber\"],\"kind\":\"graph\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":10,\"node\":\"Umber\"},\"reaches_goal\":true,\"shortest_plan\":[\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\",\"Umber\"],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":15,\"node\":\"Obsidian\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":12,\"node\":\"Sirocco\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":10,\"node\":\"Umber\"},\"legal\":true}],\"valid\":true}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Blocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"blocks\",\"on\":{\"pearl\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"TABLE\",\"onyx\":\"TABLE\"},\"goal_on\":{\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\"},\"plan\":[{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"onyx\"},{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"pearl\",\"to\":\"sapphire\"},{\"block\":\"onyx\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"onyx\"},{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"pearl\",\"to\":\"sapphire\"}],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"TABLE\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"TABLE\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
