{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"graph\",\"nodes\":[\"Nacre\",\"Vesper\",\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",\"Sirocco\"],\"edges\":[[\"Nacre\",\"Vesper\",3],[\"Vesper\",\"Obsidian\",3],[\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",1],[\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",3],[\"Quasar\",\"Umber\",4],[\"Umber\",\"Zephyr\",1],[\"Zephyr\",\"Sirocco\",2],[\"Vesper\",\"Nacre\",1],[\"Nacre\",\"Zephyr\",5],[\"Nacre\",\"Sirocco\",5],[\"Vesper\",\"Sirocco\",4],[\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\",2],[\"Tundra\",\"Nacre\",3],[\"Quasar\",\"Sirocco\",1],[\"Umber\",\"Nacre\",6],[\"Umber\",\"Vesper\",3],[\"Umber\",\"Sirocco\",2],[\"Zephyr\",\"Obsidian\",2],[\"Zephyr\",\"Umber\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Nacre\",3],[\"Sirocco\",\"Quasar\",5],[\"Sirocco\",\"Zephyr\",2]],\"start\":\"Nacre\",\"goal\":\"Sirocco\",\"fuel\":21,\"plan\":[\"Vesper\",\"Nacre\"]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":17,\"node\":\"Nacre\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[\"Sirocco\"],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":18,\"node\":\"Vesper\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":17,\"node\":\"Nacre\"},\"legal\":true}],\"valid\":true}","role":"assistant"}]}
