{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"graph\",\"nodes\":[\"Nacre\",\"Vesper\",\"Zephyr\",\"Umber\",\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\"],\"edges\":[[\"Nacre\",\"Vesper\",1],[\"Vesper\",\"Zephyr\",4],[\"Zephyr\",\"Umber\",4],[\"Umber\",\"Tundra\",1],[\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",1],[\"Quasar\",\"Obsidian\",4],[\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\",2],[\"Nacre\",\"Sirocco\",17],[\"Vesper\",\"Nacre\",2],[\"Zephyr\",\"Nacre\",4],[\"Zephyr\",\"Vesper\",5],[\"Quasar\",\"Sirocco\",3],[\"Obsidian\",\"Nacre\",1],[\"Obsidian\",\"Zephyr\",1],[\"Obsidian\",\"Tundra\",6],[\"Obsidian\",\"Quasar\",4],[\"Sirocco\",\"Tundra\",5]],\"start\":\"Nacre\",\"goal\":\"Sirocco\",\"fuel\":16,\"plan\":[\"Vesper\",\"Zephyr\",\"Umber\",\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",\"Obsidian\",\"Sirocco\"]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":1,\"node\":\"Obsidian\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[\"Vesper\",\"Zephyr\",\"Umber\",\"Tundra\",\"Quasar\",\"Sirocco\"],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":15,\"node\":\"Vesper\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":11,\"node\":\"Zephyr\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":7,\"node\":\"Umber\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":6,\"node\":\"Tundra\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":5,\"node\":\"Quasar\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":1,\"node\":\"Obsidian\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"fuel\":1,\"node\":\"Obsidian\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
