{"messages":[{"content":"Blocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[{\"to\":\"TABLE\",\"block\":\"ruby\"},{\"to\":\"TABLE\",\"block\":\"quartz\"},{\"to\":\"TABLE\",\"block\":\"onyx\"},{\"to\":\"sapphire\",\"block\":\"pearl\"},{\"to\":\"pearl\",\"block\":\"quartz\"},{\"to\":\"quartz\",\"block\":\"onyx\"},{\"to\":\"onyx\",\"block\":\"ruby\"},{\"to\":\"quartz\",\"block\":\"onyx\"}],\"goal_on\":{\"ruby\":\"onyx\",\"onyx\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"on\":{\"ruby\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"onyx\":\"sapphire\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"TABLE\"},\"kind\":\"blocks\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"quartz\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"onyx\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"onyx\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"pearl\",\"to\":\"sapphire\"},{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"pearl\"},{\"block\":\"onyx\",\"to\":\"quartz\"},{\"block\":\"ruby\",\"to\":\"onyx\"}],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"sapphire\",\"pearl\":\"TABLE\",\"quartz\":\"onyx\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"sapphire\",\"pearl\":\"TABLE\",\"quartz\":\"TABLE\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"TABLE\",\"quartz\":\"TABLE\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"TABLE\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"TABLE\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"quartz\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"TABLE\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"quartz\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"onyx\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":true},{\"after\":{\"onyx\":\"quartz\",\"pearl\":\"sapphire\",\"quartz\":\"pearl\",\"ruby\":\"onyx\",\"sapphire\":\"TABLE\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
